      55.05,
      397.14,
      295.32,
      457.02
    ],
    "text": "I, John Anthoney Emmanuel Amarathunga, Minister of Lands, herebydeclare under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of the Land AcquisitionAct, that the servitude over the lands described below in the followingparagraph 1 are needed for a public purpose and will be servitudeunder the provisions of that Act. It described in Paragraph 2 fromwhich land that the servitude will be acquried.",
